  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Program for Civil Society in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the program is to strengthen civil society organizations in the Western Balkans by providing support in the form of sub-grants, capacity building and networking/exhange of best practice.

The thematic areas are:
- Security and stability; Combatting organized crime and preventing radicalisation, including violent extremism, Reconciliation, including intercultural dialogue
- Governance; Reforms that support Euro-Atlantic integration, Human rights and gender equality, including gender-based/domestic violence, Freedom of expression and independent media</narrative>
  </description>
